u can plan your AWS costs and usage or price out setting up a new set of in=
stances and services. AWS Pricing Calculator can be accessed at <a href=3D"=
https://calculator.aws/#/">https://calculator.aws/#/</a>.</p>

<p>AWS also offers a complimentary service called Migration Evaluator (Form=
