<p>Serverless is the native architecture of the cloud that enables you to s=
hift more of your operational responsibilities to AWS, increasing your agil=
ity and innovation. Serverless allows you to build and run applications and=
 services without thinking about servers. It eliminates infrastructure mana=
gement tasks such as server or cluster provisioning, patching, operating sy=
stem maintenance, and capacity provisioning.</p>

