. The service enables you to easily rotate, manage, and retrieve database c=
redentials, API keys, and other secrets throughout their lifecycle. Users a=
nd applications retrieve secrets with a call to AWS Secrets Manager APIs, e=
liminating the need to hardcode sensitive information in plain text.</p>

<p><strong>AWS Cost &amp; Usage Report (AWS CUR)</strong> - The AWS Cost &a=
mp; Usage Report (AWS CUR) contains the most comprehensive set of cost and =
