<p>Exam Alert:</p>

<p>It is useful to note the difference between Amazon CloudWatch Billing vs=
 AWS Budgets:</p>

<p>Amazon CloudWatch Billing Alarms: Sends an alarm when the actual cost ex=
ceeds a certain threshold.</p>

<p>AWS Budgets: Sends an alarm when the actual cost exceeds the budgeted am=
ount or even when the cost forecast exceeds the budgeted amount.</p>

