<p><strong>Amazon S3 Replication</strong></p>

<p>Replication enables automatic, asynchronous copying of objects across Am=
azon S3 buckets. Buckets that are configured for object replication can be =
owned by the same AWS account or by different accounts. You can copy object=
s between different AWS Regions or within the same Region. You can use repl=
ication to make copies of your objects that retain all metadata, such as th=
e original object creation time and version IDs. This capability is importa=
nt if you need to ensure that your replica is identical to the source objec=
t.</p>

<p>Exam Alert:</p>

