nfrastructure is managed by AWS. So, Reserved Instance (RI) does not make s=
ense here. But, Amazon S3 offers volume discounts for its storage classes.<=
/p>

<p><strong>AWS Identity and Access Management (AWS IAM)</strong> - AWS Iden=
tity and Access Management (AWS IAM) enables you to manage access to AWS se=
rvices and resources securely. Using AWS Identity and Access Management (AW=
S IAM), you can create and manage IAM users and IAM user groups, and use pe=
rmissions to allow and deny their access to AWS resources. This is a free s=
ervice to every AWS customer.</p>

