<p><strong>AWS Lambda can be used to execute code in response to events suc=
h as updates to DynamoDB tables</strong></p>

<p>AWS Lambda can be configured to execute code in response to events, such=
 as changes to Amazon S3 buckets, updates to an Amazon DynamoDB table, or c=
ustom events generated by your applications or devices.</p>

<p><strong>AWS Lambda can be used for preprocessing of data before it is st=
ored in Amazon S3 buckets</strong></p>

<p>AWS Lambda can be used to run preprocessing scripts to filter, sort or t=
ransform data before sending it to downstream applications/services.</p>

<p>Incorrect options:</p>

